{"headword":"יָסַר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> discipline, chasten, admonish <strong>(</strong>Talm 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">יִ(י)סּוֹר</span>. <em>chastisement;</em> but Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">יְסַר</span> is <em>bind</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. 3 m. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיִסְּרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.11\">Is 8:11</a> (Di De SS see Bö<sup>§ 1103</sup> Ew<sup>§ 249 d</sup>, but Thes MV Che al. <strong>Pi.</strong> Pf.); 1 s. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאֶסֳּרֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:10\" href=\"/Hosea.10.10\">Ho 10:10</a> (Ges<sup>§ 71</sup>); Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָסֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.22\">1 Ch 15:22</a> (noun Ke, point as pt. Öt); Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹסֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.7\">Pr 9:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:10\" href=\"/Psalms.94.10\">ψ 94:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יסורי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.13\">Je 17:13</a> Kt v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, סוּר²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_סוּר²\">סוּר</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>admonish</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.11\">Is 8:11</a> (sq. sf. + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלֶּכֶת</span> <em>away from walking</em>, i.e. not to walk), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.7\">Pr 9:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹכִיחַ</span>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>instruct</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.22\">1 Ch 15:22</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>discipline</em>, of God <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:10\" href=\"/Hosea.10.10\">Ho 10:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:10\" href=\"/Psalms.94.10\">ψ 94:10</a>."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִוָּ֫סֶר עֶ֫בֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.19\">Pr 29:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִוָּסֵר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.18\">Je 31:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּוָּֽסְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.23\">Lv 26:23</a>; Imv. f. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִוָּֽסְרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.8\">Je 6:8</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִיָּסְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:10\" href=\"/Psalms.2.10\">ψ 2:10</a>;—(Niph. <em>tolerat</em>., Ges<sup>§ 51. 2</sup>), <em>let oneself be corrected, admonished</em> by words of man <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:10\" href=\"/Psalms.2.10\">ψ 2:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.19\">Pr 29:19</a>; <em>let oneself be chastened</em> by discipline of God <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.8\">Je 6:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.18\">31:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.23\">Lv 26:23</a>."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסַּר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.11\">1 K 12:11</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסְּרַנִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:18\" href=\"/Psalms.118.18\">ψ 118:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסְּרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.26\">Is 28:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.3\">3 f.</a> sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסְּרַתּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.1\">Pr 31:1</a>; 2 m. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסַּרְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:12\" href=\"/Psalms.39.12\">ψ 39:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:3\" href=\"/Job.4.3\">Jb 4:3</a>, etc. + 8 times Pf.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְיַסֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.5\">Dt 8:5</a>; 2 m. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּיַסְּרֶנּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:12\" href=\"/Psalms.94.12\">ψ 94:12</a>, etc. + 5 times Impf.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַסֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.18\">Pr 19:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.17\">29:17</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַסְּרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.24\">Je 10:24</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַסֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:18\" href=\"/Psalms.118.18\">ψ 118:18</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַסְּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.18\">Lv 26:18</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַסְּרֶ֑ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:36\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.36\">Dt 4:36</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְיַסְּרֶ֑ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.5\">Dt 8:5</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>discipline, correct</em> (the moral nature, with more or less severity according to circumstances):"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of God, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:15\" href=\"/Hosea.7.15\">Ho 7:15</a> (of <em>training</em> arms), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:36\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.36\">Dt 4:36</a> (v. Dr), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.5\">8:5</a> (Israel as son), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.26\">Is 28:26</a>, happy the man <span dir=\"rtl\">אשׁר תיסרנו יהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:12\" href=\"/Psalms.94.12\">ψ 94:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:18\" href=\"/Psalms.118.18\">118:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of man, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.5\">Dt 8:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.18\">Pr 19:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.17\">29:17</a> (all of a father his son), <a data-ref=\"Job 4:3\" href=\"/Job.4.3\">Jb 4:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.1\">Pr 31:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:7\" href=\"/Psalms.16.7\">ψ 16:7</a> my reins (the emotions of my own heart) <em>correct, admonish</em> me."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"more severely, <em>chasten, chastise:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of God, sq. acc. pers., <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.18\">Je 31:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל־בַּחֲמָֽתְךָ תְיַסְּרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:2\" href=\"/Psalms.6.2\">ψ 6:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:2\" href=\"/Psalms.38.2\">38:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּמשׁפט אל באף</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.24\">Je 10:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">למשׁפט</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.11\">30:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.28\">46:28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">על חטאת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.18\">Lv 26:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.28\">28</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בתוכחות על עון</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:12\" href=\"/Psalms.39.12\">ψ 39:12</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of man, a father his son <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.18\">Dt 21:18</a>; elders a man <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.18\">Dt 22:18</a> (including, as perhaps <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.18\">21:18</a>, bodily chastisement); a king his subjects <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשּׁוֹטִים</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעַקְרַבִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.11\">1 K 12:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.14\">14</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.11\">2 Ch 10:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.14\">14</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">תְּיַסְּרֵךְ רָֽעָתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.19\">Je 2:19</a> <em>thy badness will chastise thee</em>."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִוַּסְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:48\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.48\">Ez 23:48</a> (for <span dir=\"rtl\">נִתְוַסְּרוּ</span> Ges<sup>§ 55 k</sup>); pass. <em>be disciplined, corrected</em>."}],"form":"Nithp."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. 1 s. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַיְסִירֵם</span> (Ew<sup>§ 131 c</sup>, but error for <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲיַסְּרֵם</span> Bö<sup>§ 437 f</sup> SS), c. acc. <em>chasten</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:12\" href=\"/Hosea.7.12\">Ho 7:12</a>."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB04020","strong_numbers":["3256"],"next_hw":"יִסּוֹר","prev_hw":"יוֹסִפְיָה","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["3579","3580"],"TWOT":["877"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}